<title>HUNGARY: Hungary BUX end officially at 5,849.41 pts, up 45.36.</title>
<headline>Hungary BUX end officially at 5,849.41 pts, up 45.36.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The BUX index of the Budapest Stock Exchange closed at an official 5,849.41 points, up 45.36, compared to a preliminary close of 5,847.71 points, up 43.66.</p>
<p>Spot share turnover totalled 3.49 billion forints.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
